SUMMARY: In this research task, we aim to summarize the handling of multi-tenant GPU sharing across published systems and identify the point of disagreement among them. The fact-check agent did not provide any findings. The web-search agent found information on specific mechanisms used by published systems for multi-tenant GPU sharing, but no detailed mechanisms were provided. The paper-search agent located relevant papers discussing multi-tenant GPU sharing mechanisms, but no specific disagreements were highlighted. Further analysis and data collection are needed to provide a comprehensive summary of the handling of multi-tenant GPU sharing and the points of disagreement among the published systems.
